description	"Davik Kang

The feared head of the Exchange on Taris. A master of logistics and hired muscle, Davik fights through his extensive network of droids and enforcers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Exchange Heavy Pistol
-- Pistol 3, 5%+ Damage/RoF
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Personal Shield
- Call Goto, The Boss (Support Beacon) ^3[CS1]
- Healing (1)
- Personal Exchange Guard (Round Spawner)
- Blast Armor
- Rally
- Exchange Network (Tracking Beacon)
- Large Medpack
- Anti MT (1)
- Sentry Turret ^3[CS3]
- Defense Done ^3[CS4]
- Seeker Drone ^3[CS2]"
